OL,4,CComedian impersonates Trump's dance    
OL,5,Cmoves, mocks trade talks at Canada     
OL,6,Cpress dinner                           
OL,7,GPrime Minister Mark Carney brought a   
OL,8,GDonald Trump impersonator on stage at  
OL,9,GOttawa's annual press gallery dinner,  
OL,10,Gwhere he poked fun at strained US-     
OL,11,GCanada relations and on-again, off-    
OL,12,Gagain trade talks.                     
OL,14,FThe impersonator, played by comedian   
OL,15,FMark Critch of the sketch comedy show  
OL,16,FThis Hour Has 22 Minutes, came out     
OL,17,Fafter Carney jokingly pressed an       
OL,18,F"emergency comedy button" during his   
OL,19,Fspeech.                                
